  "description": {
   "en": "Hae-soo used to be a reporter for the City Department, who led a proper life and enjoyed helping those in need through his articles. That is…until he was transferred to the Entertainment Department and became the worst-performing reporter. As he felt more and more desperate to come up with a good story, his former colleague hooked him up with the tickets to an after-party, where he met the hottest celebrity, Kang Min-woo. During the party, Min-woo takes an interest in Hae-soo and makes him an interesting proposition that could potentially benefit both of them. However, as Hae-soo begins to help Min-woo and go along with his plans, he can’t help but feel that Min-woo wants more than just an acting partner. Hae-soo can’t turn Min-woo down because he needs the scoop! What does Min-woo want with Hae-soo? How will Hae-soo protect his life between his crumbling job and his shady informant?\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/close_up)\n\n**Official Translations:** [English](https://www.lezhinus.com/en/comic/closeup), [Japanese](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/close_up)"
  },
